---@field auto_updates? hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestAutoUpdates|string|distilled.Null WordPress core auto-update policy
---@field version? string|distilled.Null WordPress core version to install. If omitted, the latest core version compatible with the account vhost PHP version is selected.
---@field credentials hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestCredentials WordPress admin credentials
---@field database? hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestDatabase|distilled.Null Optional. If the named database already exists on the account, it is used for this WordPress install. Otherwise a new database is created with this name, or with a generated name when database is omitted or null. A new database gets a random database user and counts toward the plan's database limit.

---WordPress core auto-update policy
---@alias hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestAutoUpdates "all"|"none"|"minor"

---WordPress admin credentials
---@class hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestCredentials
---@field email string
---@field login string WordPress admin username
---@field password string|distilled.Secret

---Optional. If the named database already exists on the account, it is used for this WordPress install. Otherwise a new database is created with this name, or with a generated name when database is omitted or null. A new database gets a random database user and counts toward the plan's database limit.
---@class hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestDatabase
---@field name? string Database name (username prefix added if missing)
---@field password? string|distilled.Secret|distilled.Null Password for a new database. Random when omitted or null. Ignored when the named database already exists.

---Installation kind; `default` when omitted. `headless` installs WordPress into the `cms` directory with the Hostinger headless MU plugin and marks the website as a headless WordPress website. Accepted only for a website that is already headless, e.g. one created by `POST /api/hosting/v1/orders/{order_id}/onboardings` (`hosting_websites_create`) with `type: headless_empty`; any other website is rejected with 422.
---@alias hostinger.InstallHostingWordPressV1RequestType "default"|"headless"

