---@return hostinger.CommonSuccessEmptyResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:connect_reach_ai_website_builder_site_v1(input) end

---Connect Ecommerce store
---
---Connect one of the customer's eCommerce stores to the profile, so Reach receives its
---customers and orders.
---
---Take `store_id` from the list eCommerce stores endpoint. Fails with not found
---(`ECOMMERCE_STORE_NOT_FOUND`) when the store is not one of the customer's own stores, also
---when the eCommerce service cannot be reached. Fails with a conflict
---(`ECOMMERCE_CONNECTION_ALREADY_EXISTS`) when the store is connected to any profile or this
---profile already has a store - to move a store to another plan, disconnect it from the
---profile that holds it first.
---
---`POST /api/reach/v1/profiles/{profileUuid}/ecommerce/stores/{storeId}`
---Errors: Conflict.
---@param input hostinger.ConnectReachEcommerceStoreV1Request
---@return hostinger.ReachV1StoresConnectionResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:connect_reach_ecommerce_store_v1(input) end

---Connect sending domain
---
---Connect a sending domain to the profile so emails can be sent from addresses on it.
---
---Connecting does not make the domain ready to send: check the DNS status endpoint next for
---records that are still missing. A domain the account owns or has already verified connects
---immediately. Any other domain starts a TXT ownership verification and returns `409`;
---complete the verification in Reach, then retry. Returns `422` when the profile or another
---profile already has the domain, the domain is blocked, or its ownership cannot be verified.
---An already connected domain is never replaced.
---
---On success the sender address of draft and scheduled campaigns, and of published automation
---and double opt-in emails, moves onto the new domain in the background, keeping the part
---before the `@`.
---
---`POST /api/reach/v1/profiles/{profileUuid}/domains`
---Errors: Conflict, UnprocessableEntity.
---@param input hostinger.ConnectReachSendingDomainV1Request
---@return hostinger.CommonSuccessEmptyResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:connect_reach_sending_domain_v1(input) end

---Create a new website
---
---Provisions a new website on one of your Agency Plan hosting orders.
