---@param input hostinger.GetHostingCronJobOutputV1Request
---@return hostinger.HostingV1CronJobsCronJobOutputResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_hosting_cron_job_output_v1(input) end

---Get generation result
---
---Get the result of an AI content generation started for the specified WordPress
---installation, such as an image generation started with
---POST /api/hosting/v1/accounts/{username}/wordpress/{software}/content/images/generate.
---
---While the generation is still running only `status: in-progress` is returned; poll every
---few seconds. Once `completed`, `result` holds the generated content shaped according to
---`type`: temporary image URLs together with the time they expire for `image-generation`, or
---the generated website document for `website-generation` (started from the Hostinger
---WordPress plugin). A `failed` generation has no `result`. Unknown or expired generation
---IDs return 404.
---
---Provide the WordPress installation (software) identifier in the path. It can
---be obtained from GET /api/hosting/v1/wordpress/installations (the `id` field).
---
---`GET /api/hosting/v1/accounts/{username}/wordpress/{software}/content/generations/{generation_id}`
---Errors: NotFound, UnprocessableEntity.
---@param input hostinger.GetHostingGenerationResultV1Request
---@return hostinger.WordPressV1ContentGenerationResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_hosting_generation_result_v1(input) end

---Get Git auto-deployment settings
---
---Returns the Git auto-deployment settings of the website: which repository and branch deploy
---into which directory, and whether pushes trigger a deployment. `is_enabled` false keeps the
---repository link but ignores pushes.
---
---When the website has no auto-deployment configured every field is null. Save settings with
---`Update Git auto-deployment settings`.
---
---`GET /api/hosting/v1/accounts/{username}/websites/{domain}/git/auto-deployments/settings`
---@param input hostinger.GetHostingGitAutoDeploymentSettingsV1Request
---@return hostinger.HostingV1GitGitAutoDeploymentSettingsResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_hosting_git_auto_deployment_settings_v1(input) end

---Get Git SSH public key
---
---Returns the public SSH key of the hosting account. `Deploy website Git repository` uses this key to
---clone and pull over SSH, so a private repository works once the key is added to it as a deploy key
---on the Git host. `public_key` is null when the account has no key yet.
---
---`GET /api/hosting/v1/accounts/{username}/git/ssh-key`
---@param input hostinger.GetHostingGitSSHPublicKeyV1Request
---@return hostinger.HostingV1GitGitSshKeyResource? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_hosting_git_ssh_public_key_v1(input) end

